<title>UK: CRICKET-SCOTLAND WIN TOSS, PUT AUSTRALIA IN TO BAT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SCOTLAND WIN TOSS, PUT AUSTRALIA IN TO BAT.</headline>
<dateline>EDINBURGH 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotland won the toss and put</p>
<p>Australia in to bat in their one-day cricket match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Teams:</p>
<p>Scotland - B.Patterson, I.Philip, D.Lockhart, M.Smith,</p>
<p>G.Salmond (captain), J.Williamson, I.Stanger, P.Steindl,</p>
<p>I.Beven, K.Sheridan, K.Thomson.</p>
<p>Australia - M.Slater, J.Langer, R.Ponting, G.Blewett,</p>
<p>S.Waugh (captain), M.Waugh, I.Healy, B.Julian, J.Gillespie,</p>
<p>M.Kasprowicz, G.McGrath.</p>
</text>
